  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Verified call path",
      "items": [
        "Only the assistant and the files module (document AI) call models; every call goes through RoleService.gateway_for_role / metered_gateway (assistant/service.py, files/search.py, files/internal/rerank.py).",
        "adapter_for(kind) picks the adapter by the provider's adapter kind (adapters.py:80-92). Gateway → adapter arrows are that runtime choice."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Checks on every call",
      "items": [
        "Internal-only Workspace: an external provider is refused (409 external_provider_refused), whatever the role.",
        "Monthly token and cost budgets (installation and Workspace) are checked first; usage is recorded per call in llm_usage.",
        "A failure before any output tries the role's fallback models in order (agent and light roles)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Gateway behaviour",
      "items": [
        "Normalises messages, tool calls, stream events, usage and errors: no other code sees a vendor format or imports a vendor SDK.",
        "Retries rate-limit / unavailable errors with backoff up to 3 times, only until the first stream event.",
        "Estimates tokens when the provider reports none."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Inferred or not drawn",
      "items": [
        "Plugin adapters (dawam.llm_providers entry points) can reach any provider; none ship with DAWAM, so the arrow is dashed and its target not drawn.",
        "Anthropic and Bedrock have no embeddings (anthropic.py docstring, README); per-adapter vision and rerank support was not traced.",
        "Exact backoff timings were not read."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
